{"title":"2022 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/69316b06ec70baeb79f5f4982024e2523d587809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\sqrt{81} + \\sqrt{9} - \\sqrt{64}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"155\" height=\"35\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Solving_First.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Solving_First)\">Solution 1 (Solving First)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Solving First)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/4812c690335f64b6bbcc2b57c497fa4f38b47c4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\sqrt{81} + \\sqrt{9} - \\sqrt{64}} = \\sqrt{9 + 3 - 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"266\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/7/b979aa13362b832c121fe9872caf20edb1494c72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{12 - 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/d/c1d7279ae42600ccd353e8714f99afbd6b76a8fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd2df5d37ffc0af3866011f5f56f4b4710626b3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018021616\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 27/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 982/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.787      1 2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.787      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36000:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018021616 and revision id 279600. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}